    <node id="&quot;SIMEON SMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Simeon Smith was a local craftsman who built the Simeon P. Smith House in 1810-11 and later moved to West Haven, Vermont, where he became a wealthy businessman and politician."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WILLIAM SPRAT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"William Sprat was a prominent housewright from Litchfield, Connecticut, who designed the Simeon Smith House in West Haven, Vermont, in 1798-1800."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912</data>
    </node>
